[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-opec-fund-young-professional-development-program-2026-apply-now-69":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},69,"opec-fund-young-professional-development-program-2026-apply-now-69","Opec Fund Young Professional Development Program 2026 | Apply Now","\u003Cp>Applications are now opened for the OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program 2026. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program 2026 Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: OPEC Fund\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: AT\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category:  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Trainings\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Coaching\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hand on experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment Opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 11, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Trainings\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Coaching\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>on the job  experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment Opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Online Course Platform\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>OPEC Fund Member Country national\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be 30 years of age or younger at the time of application\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have obtained at least a Master’s degree from a reputable university\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent Academic performance \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be fluent in English\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proficiency in one or more languages is desirable\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a minimum of 3 years of work experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Specialize in a field relevant to the OPEC Fund’s operations, such as Engineering, Economics, Finance, Business Administration, Information Technology, Law, Human Resources, and any other relevant discipline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ability to work in a global and culturally diverse institution\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>An understanding of the OPEC Fund’s mandate\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Willingness to serve the OPEC Fund, if selected, for a minimum of two years upon completion of the Program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the OPEC Fund Young Professional Development Program 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A YPDP online application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A Curriculum Vitae (CV)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>An application essay (in Word or PDF format)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic certificates and transcripts.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apllication essay In fewer than 1,000 words, please write an original essay addressing:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>the potential of development actors such as the OPEC Fund to help developing countries overcome obstacles to social, environmental and economic progress\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>how you would hope to contribute to development if you were selected to work for the OPEC Fund.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcareers.opecfund.org\u002Fjob\u002FYoung-Professional-Development-Program-2026\u002F1354445757\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fcareers.opecfund.org\u002Fjob\u002FYoung-Professional-Development-Program-2026\u002F1354445757\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-11 10:21:16",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fopec-fund-young-professional-development-program-2026-apply-now\u002F69b1340c0637a9.39465332_screenshot 2026-03-11 101423.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fopec-fund-young-professional-development-program-2026-apply-now\u002F69b1340c0637a9.39465332_screenshot%202026-03-11%20101423.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":